   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Round trips",
     "texto": [
      "**ходил/ходила/ходили** (on foot) and **ездил/ездила/ездили** (by vehicle) usually describe a visit or a round trip. They can also express repeated or regular trips.",
      "**Вчера я ходил в кино** = yesterday I went to the cinema. **Летом мы ездили в Москву** = in summer we went to Moscow.",
      "As with the whole past, the form agrees with the subject: **ходил/ездил** (masculine singular), **ходила/ездила** (feminine singular), **ходили/ездили** (plural)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two verbs for each action",
     "texto": [
      "Many verbs form aspect pairs, but the prefix is not always enough to predict the meaning. The **imperfective** focuses on the process, a habitual or repeated action; the **perfective** presents a bounded event or a result.",
      "Я читал книгу can mean that I was reading or that I read for a while; Я прочитал книгу presents the reading as completed. The context decides the natural translation."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Verb pairs",
     "columnas": [
